[{"id":"fm-core2-2.52-q1","number":1,"question":"<p><strong>The following questions require Reciprocal Trigonometric Functions, Harmonic Form, and use of Compound Angle and Double Angle Formulae</strong></p><p>Write the following polar equations in Cartesian form, giving your answers in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"ax+by=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a,b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers or surds to be found:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=\\sec\\left(\\theta-\\frac\\pi3\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=\\sec\\left(\\theta+\\frac\\pi6\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=\\operatorname{cosec}\\left(\\theta+\\frac\\pi4\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=4\\operatorname{cosec}\\left(\\theta-\\frac\\pi6\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r\\cos\\left(\\theta-\\frac\\pi3\\right)=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r\\cos\\theta\\cos\\frac\\pi3+r\\sin\\theta\\sin\\frac\\pi3=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x\\cos\\frac\\pi3+y\\sin\\frac\\pi3=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac12x+\\frac{\\sqrt3}2y=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x+\\sqrt3y=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r\\cos\\left(\\theta+\\frac\\pi6\\right)=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r\\cos\\theta\\cos\\frac\\pi6-r\\sin\\theta\\sin\\frac\\pi6=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x\\cos\\frac\\pi6-y\\sin\\frac\\pi6=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{\\sqrt3}2x-\\frac12y=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sqrt3x-y=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r\\sin\\left(\\theta+\\frac\\pi4\\right)=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r\\sin\\theta\\cos\\frac\\pi4+r\\cos\\theta\\sin\\frac\\pi4=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y\\cos\\frac\\pi4+x\\sin\\frac\\pi4=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{\\sqrt2}2y+\\frac{\\sqrt2}2x=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sqrt2x+\\sqrt2y=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r\\sin\\left(\\theta-\\frac\\pi6\\right)=4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r\\sin\\theta\\cos\\frac\\pi6-r\\cos\\theta\\sin\\frac\\pi6=4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y\\cos\\frac\\pi6-x\\sin\\frac\\pi6=4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{\\sqrt3}2y-\\frac12x=4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x-\\sqrt3y=-8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.52-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Find the Cartesian equation for each of the following curves:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=3+\\cos2\\theta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r^2=\\sin2\\theta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r^2=3\\sec2\\theta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r^2=9\\operatorname{cosec}2\\theta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=6\\cot\\theta\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r=3+\\cos2\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r=3+\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^3=3r^2+r^2\\cos^2\\theta-r^2\\sin^2\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(x^2+y^2)^{3/2}=3x^2+3y^2+x^2-y^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(x^2+y^2)^{3/2}=4x^2+2y^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2=\\sin2\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2=2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^4=2r^2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(x^2+y^2)^2=2xy\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2=3\\sec2\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2\\cos2\\theta=3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2(\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta)=3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2\\cos^2\\theta-r^2\\sin^2\\theta=3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2-y^2=3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2=9\\operatorname{cosec}2\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2\\sin2\\theta=9\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2(2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta)=9\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2r\\sin\\theta r\\cos\\theta=9\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"xy=\\frac92\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r=6\\cot\\theta\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r=6\\times\\frac{\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}\\times\\frac1{\\sin\\theta}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r\\sin^2\\theta=6\\cos\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2\\sin^2\\theta=6r\\cos\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y^2=6x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.52-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>The Cartesian equation</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(x^2+y^2)^2=x^2-y^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>when written in Polar form is given by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r^2=\\mathrm f(\\theta)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(\\theta)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in its simplest form.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(x^2+y^2)^2=x^2-y^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^4=r^2\\cos^2\\theta-r^2\\sin^2\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2=\\cos2\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\mathrm f(\\theta)=\\cos2\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.52-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>The Cartesian equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> when written in Polar form is given by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r^2=\\mathrm f(\\theta)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathrm f(\\theta)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in its simplest form.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r\\sin\\theta=\\frac1{r\\cos\\theta}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2=\\frac1{\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2=\\frac2{2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2=\\frac2{\\sin2\\theta}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r^2=2\\operatorname{cosec}2\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\mathrm f(\\theta)=2\\operatorname{cosec}2\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.52-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>It is known that the complex number <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z\" data-display=\"false\"></span> satisfies</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"|z-6+8i|=10\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Sketch the locus of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z\" data-display=\"false\"></span> on an Argand diagram.</p></li><li><p>Show that this locus of points can be represented by the polar curve</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r=12\\cos\\theta-16\\sin\\theta\" data-display=\"true\"></span></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Circle centred at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(6,-8)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with radius 10</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.52/solutions/assets/diagrams/252-p3-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(x-6)^2+(y+8)^2=100\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2-12x+36+y^2+16y+64=100\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"